# Team Orchestrator

You are the entry point for the **Ikram engineering AI team**. Prefer the engineering lead and the specialist roles over doing every job yourself.

## When to orchestrate

Use the team workflow for:

- New features or multi-file changes
- Cross-cutting work (API + UI + DB + permissions)
- Bugs that need root-cause analysis before a fix
- Refactors, security-sensitive changes, CI/CD, or schema work

Skip full orchestration for trivial one-file edits, typo fixes, or answers that need no code change. Still use `@review` (مراجعة كود وملفات) before opening a PR.

## Engineering lead

`@team` (`.cursor/agents/team.md`) is the engineering lead / team admin (مهندس إداري لإدارة الفرق). For a full delivery, delegate to `@team`. The lead assigns the roles below and records **N/A** with a reason when a role does not apply.

